#: docs/silkie/reference.rst:4
msgid ""
"Silkie extends kitty with tablet and touch input, gestures, terminal-side ink, vector graphics, "
"HDR, and display and presentation feedback. This reference specifies Silkie's additions: their "
"escape sequences, fields, units, replies, configuration, and implementation limits."
msgstr "Silkie 为 kitty 增添了数位板与触摸输入、手势、终端侧墨迹、矢量图形、HDR，以及显示信息与画面呈现反馈。本手册规定了 Silkie 扩展的转义序列、字段、单位、回复、配置和实现限制。"

#: docs/silkie/reference.rst:9
msgid ""
"Start with :doc:`capabilities-protocol` to discover what a terminal supports, then :doc"
":`extension-framing` for the framing and timing rules shared by the OSC 777 protocols. :doc"
":`show-pointer` provides an interactive input inspector."
msgstr ""
"先通过 :doc:`capabilities-protocol` 探测终端支持的功能，再阅读 :doc:`extension-framing`，了解 OSC 777 "
"协议共用的封装与时序规则。:doc:`show-pointer` 提供交互式输入检查工具。"

#: docs/silkie/reference.rst:13
msgid ""
"For the project overview, see :doc:`index`. For installation, see :doc:`install`. The :doc"
":`developer-guide` connects these extensions to kitty's protocols, kitten tools, and the "
"underlying terminal conventions."
msgstr ""
"项目概览见 :doc:`index`，安装方法见 :doc:`install`。:doc:`developer-guide` 介绍这些扩展与 kitty 协议、kitten "
"工具及基础终端约定之间的关系。"

